<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipt estimate was 100,000 head, compared with 100,000 a week ago and 103,000 a year ago. Estimates include generally 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs.</p>
<p>Barrows and gilts $1.00 per cwt lower than midsession Friday. Trade was moderate for light to moderate demand and offerings. Some plants closed in observance of Presidents Day.</p>
